        "text": "<b>Translation:</b> (29) And [mention, O Muhammad], when We directed to you a few of the jinn, listening to the Qur'an. And when they attended it, they said, \"Listen quietly.\" And when it was concluded, they went back to their people as warners. (30) They said, \"O our people, indeed we have heard a [recited] Book revealed after Moses confirming what was before it which guides to the truth and to a straight path. (31) O our people, respond to the Messenger of Allah and believe in him; Allah will forgive your sins and protect you from painful punishment. (32) But he who does not respond to the Caller of Allah will not cause failure [to Him] upon earth, and he will not have besides Him any protectors. Those are in manifest error.\"\n\n<b>11. Ar-rahman: 33-36</b>\n\n<ar> ┘è┘Ä╪º ┘à┘Ä╪╣┘Æ╪┤┘Ä╪▒┘Ä ╪º┘ä┘Æ╪¼┘É┘å┘É┘æ ┘ê┘Ä╪º┘ä┘Æ╪Ñ┘É┘å╪│┘É ╪Ñ┘É┘å┘É ╪º╪│┘Æ╪¬┘Ä╪╖┘Ä╪╣┘Æ╪¬┘Å┘à┘Æ ╪ú┘Ä┘å ╪¬┘Ä┘å┘ü┘Å╪░┘Å┘ê╪º ┘à┘É┘å┘Æ ╪ú┘Ä┘é┘Æ╪╖┘Ä╪º╪▒┘É ╪º┘ä╪│┘æ┘Ä┘à┘Ä╪º┘ê┘Ä╪º╪¬┘É ┘ê┘Ä╪º┘ä┘Æ╪ú┘Ä╪▒┘Æ╪╢┘É ┘ü┘Ä╪º┘å┘ü┘Å╪░┘Å┘ê╪º █Ü ┘ä┘Ä╪º ╪¬┘Ä┘å┘ü┘Å╪░┘Å┘ê┘å┘Ä ╪Ñ┘É┘ä┘æ┘Ä╪º ╪¿┘É╪│┘Å┘ä┘Æ╪╖┘Ä╪º┘å┘ì ∩┤┐┘ú┘ú∩┤╛ ┘ü┘Ä╪¿┘É╪ú┘Ä┘è┘É┘æ ╪ó┘ä┘Ä╪º╪í┘É ╪▒┘Ä╪¿┘É┘æ┘â┘Å┘à┘Ä╪º ╪¬┘Å┘â┘Ä╪░┘É┘æ╪¿┘Ä╪º┘å┘É ∩┤┐┘ú┘ñ∩┤╛ ┘è┘Å╪▒┘Æ╪│┘Ä┘ä┘Å ╪╣┘Ä┘ä┘Ä┘è┘Æ┘â┘Å┘à┘Ä╪º ╪┤┘Å┘ê┘Ä╪º╪╕┘î ┘à┘É┘æ┘å ┘å┘æ┘Ä╪º╪▒┘ì ┘ê┘Ä┘å┘Å╪¡┘Ä╪º╪│┘î ┘ü┘Ä┘ä┘Ä╪º ╪¬┘Ä┘å╪¬┘Ä╪╡┘É╪▒┘Ä╪º┘å┘É ∩┤┐┘ú┘Ñ∩┤╛ ┘ü┘Ä╪¿┘É╪ú┘Ä┘è┘É┘æ ╪ó┘ä┘Ä╪º╪í┘É ╪▒┘Ä╪¿┘É┘æ┘â┘Å┘à┘Ä╪º ╪¬┘Å┘â┘Ä╪░┘É┘æ╪¿┘Ä╪º┘å┘É ∩┤┐┘ú┘ª∩┤╛ </ar>\n\n<b>Translation:</b> (33) O company of jinn and mankind, if you are able to pass beyond the regions of the heavens and the earth, then pass. You will not pass except by authority [from Allah ]. (34) So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny? (35) There will be sent upon you a flame of fire and smoke, and you will not defend yourselves. (36) So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny?\n\n<b>12. Al-Hashr: 21-24</b>"
